category: Libs
requires: libtbb12 libtbbbind_2_5_3 libtbbmalloc2 pkg-config
sdesc: "oneAPI Threading Building Blocks (development)"
ldesc: "oneAPI Threading Building Blocks (oneTBB) lets you easily write parallel C++
programs that take full advantage of multicore performance, that are portable,
composable and have future-proof scalability."
external-source: onetbb

